WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.032
CTEs are not automatically better A short query may
be clearer

00:00:06.058 --> 00:00:11.622
without one A CTE also does not repair unclear grain

00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:19.271
And it does not automatically make a query faster
Use named stages

00:00:19.298 --> 00:00:21.798
when they improve reasoning and maintainability
